<Layout title="Our Team | RIPL Wealth" description="Meet the people behind RIPL Wealth and learn how our team helps organize your financial life.">
<section class="about-feature about-intro"><div class="wrap"><div class="about-intro-heading"><div class="eyebrow">MEET RIPL</div><h1 class="about-title">Real people.<span class="about-title-highlight">Working together.</span></h1></div><div class="about-intro-row"><div class="editorial-image"><div class="ripl-photo-frame" data-motion><div class="photo-frame-image"><img src="/images/ripl-home-team.jpg" alt="The RIPL team in their Fort Collins office" loading="lazy"></div></div></div><div class="about-copy"><p>Your business, family, taxes, and investments are connected. We help you see how they fit together, organize what needs attention, and make decisions with greater clarity.</p><p>Meet the people who help turn that clarity into a plan, and keep it moving.</p><div class="page-actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a><a class="text-link" href="#ripl-team">Meet Your Team ↓</a></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="section about-decisions"><div class="wrap split"><h2>Every decision stays exactly where it belongs.<br>With you.</h2><div class="about-decisions-copy"><figure class="about-chase-quote"><blockquote>“Smart people make excellent decisions when they can see all of their options.”</blockquote><figcaption>Chase Bellefeuille <span>· Managing Partner</span></figcaption></figure><p>Our role is to help you see those options, understand the tradeoffs, and choose what fits your life.</p><p>You get a team, a coordinated process, and people who know your situation. Serious work, clear explanations, and room to enjoy the relationship.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="section questions" id="ripl-team"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR TEAM</div><h2>The people behind RIPL.</h2><div class="team-grid"><article><div class="ripl-photo-frame" data-motion><div class="photo-frame-image"><img src="/images/chase-team-office.png" alt="Chase Bellefeuille" loading="lazy"></div></div><h3>Chase Bellefeuille</h3><span class="team-role">Managing Partner</span><p>The thinking and philosophy behind RIPL. Connects the vision for your life with the strategy for your wealth.</p><a class="team-bio-link" href="/team/chase-bellefeuille/">Learn More About Chase →</a></article><article><div class="ripl-photo-frame" data-motion><div class="photo-frame-image"><img src="/images/adam-team-office.png" alt="Adam Kasick" loading="lazy"></div></div><h3>Adam Kasick</h3><span class="team-role">Wealth Manager</span><p>A business-owner perspective on organizing your financial life, understanding your options, and giving capital a purpose.</p><a class="team-bio-link" href="/team/adam-kasick/">Learn More About Adam →</a></article><article><div class="ripl-photo-frame" data-motion><div class="photo-frame-image"><img src="/images/ashton-team-office.png" alt="Ashton Anderson" loading="lazy"></div></div><h3>Ashton Anderson</h3><span class="team-role">Chief of Staff</span><p>The operational architect who helps the firm run with clarity and intention.</p><a class="team-bio-link" href="/team/ashton-anderson/">Learn More About Ashton →</a></article><article><div class="ripl-photo-frame" data-motion><div class="photo-frame-image"><img src="/images/tasha-team-office.png" alt="Tasha Skott" loading="lazy"></div></div><h3>Tasha Skott</h3><span class="team-role">Experience Lead</span><p>The standard of care behind every interaction. Thoughtful details and a welcoming experience.</p><a class="team-bio-link" href="/team/tasha-skott/">Learn More About Tasha →</a></article></div></div></section>

<section class="final-cta"><div class="wrap"><h2>Don’t worry about getting everything organized first.</h2><p>Tell us what’s on your mind. We’ll figure out what we actually need from there.</p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a></div></section>


